# Units & Dimensions

## Units

- **All numeric coordinates are millimeters (mm)**. Never use meters or cm.
- Set on every new drawing:
  ```
  (setvar "INSUNITS" 4)   ; 4 = mm
  (setvar "MEASUREMENT" 1) ; metric
  (setvar "LUNITS" 2)
  (setvar "AUNITS" 0)
  ```

## Default thicknesses (mm)

| Element                       | Thickness |
|-------------------------------|-----------|
| Reinforced concrete outer wall | 250–300  |
| Brick / block outer wall       | 200      |
| Plastered inner partition      | 120      |
| Light partition (drywall)      |  80–100  |
| Reinforced concrete slab       | 200      |
| Floor finish layer             |  20–50   |

