| Master bedroom    | 12            | 2700                 |
| Bedroom           |  9            | 2400                 |
| Living room       | 16            | 3000                 |
| Kitchen           |  6            | 1800                 |
| Bathroom (full)   |  3.3          | 1500                 |
| WC only           |  1.0          |  900                 |
| Corridor          |  —            |  900 (1100 ADA)      |

## Dimension lines

- Two parallel dim chains on each axis: per-bay dims close to the plan,
  total dim further out (about 1100 mm offset).
- Tick mark length 100 mm.
- Text height 280 mm, on layer `DIM`.

## Standard layer set

| Layer        | Color | Use                                       |
|--------------|-------|-------------------------------------------|
| `WALL`       | 7     | Filled (SOLID hatch) walls                |
| `WALL-INNER` | 8     | Inner partitions                          |
| `DOOR`       | 4     | Door swings + leaf line                   |
| `WINDOW`     | 5     | Window frame + glass line                 |
| `FURN`       | 3     | Furniture / fixed fittings                |
| `FIX`        | 6     | Plumbing fixtures                         |
| `GRID`       | 1     | Structural grid axes                      |
| `AXIS-LABEL` | 1     | Grid bubbles A/B/C, 1/2/3                 |
| `DIM`        | 2     | Dimensions                                |
| `TEXT`       | 7     | All text and title block content          |
| `TITLE`      | 7     | Sheet frame and title block lines         |
